		You sit and lean against the wall, ignoring the pile of straw. You're not an animal. It takes a while to fall asleep. You're awoken by a heavy rattling.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
A weak light pierces the high windows. It's dawn.
<<wakingEffects true>>
<br><br>

<<if dangerEvent()>>
	<<if $livestock.obey gte 80 and C.npc.Remy.love gte 80 and random(80, 110) lte C.npc.Remy.love>>
		<<npc "Remy">><<person1>>
		You stir at the sound of footsteps approaching your cell. The rest of the barn is quiet, save for the occasional snore from one of the other cows. It takes a few moments for your eyes to adjust well enough to see Remy's face outside of your door.
		<br><br>

		<<if _lockBroken>>
			<<He>> smiles at you, and goes to unlock your cell door, before <span class="purple">finding the lock already broken open</span>. <<He>> looks at you for a moment<<if C.npc.Remy.love is 100>>, <span class="green">before shaking <<his>> head</span>.<<else>> <span class="red">and <<his>> eyes narrow slightly</span>.<</if>> "These locks, never reliable. Don't worry, we'll get this one replaced."<<if C.npc.Remy.love lt 100>><<livestock_obey -10>><<llobey>><</if>>
			<br><br>

			<<He>> opens your cell door and steps inside, kneeling down next to you. "You've been such a good <<girl>> for me lately. The pride of the farm." <<if $cow gte 6>> The thought makes you feel good.<<stress -4>><<lstress>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> smiles at you, and unlocks your cell door, stepping inside. "You've been such a good <<girl>> for me lately. The pride of the farm." <<if $cow gte 6>> The thought makes you feel good.<<stress -4>><<lstress>><</if>>
			<br><br>

			<<He>> kneels down next to you, and reaches out a hand towards your head. <<He>> begins to pet you. <<if $cow gte 6>> The feeling of <<his>> hand against your scalp sends warm shivers down your back.<<arousal 800>><<garousal>><</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Let <<him>> continue|Livestock Cell Remy]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<transform cow 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Pull away|Livestock Cell Remy]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		Your eyes adjust, and you see a <<person>> stood outside your cell, watching you. <<He>> glances over your shoulder. "Shouldn't get caught if I'm quick," <<he>> mutters to <<himself>> as <<he>> opens the gate. You try to stand, but <<he>> pushes you back onto the straw.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Livestock Cell Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Livestock Cell]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

